# Questers really accept, perform and turn in quests through Playerbots.
# They do not use resident stay/leash/emote behaviour, and always require full Playerbots AI activity.
# QuestZoneId is a zone ID; QuestRadius is yards around the first SQL hotspot.
# Quest givers, objectives and reward points must fit that zone and radius.
# QuestIdleSeconds measures actual quest progress; ResidenceSeconds rotates participants.
# Questers share CityLife.Population.MaxTotal with residents, independently of the PvP population.

